comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T23:47:23.453Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: item merges now emit structured scalar decisions into a Git-local pm-merge-receipts store; pm merge report exposes the recoverable retained/discarded values locally, while committed history receives only field names, provenance, and SHA-256 value hashes. Receipt damage/outside-Git behavior, reconciliation state, CLI usage, public SDK exports, and privacy-safe history assertions are covered. The packed branch proof produced count=1 and reconciled=1."
  "2026-07-26T23:49:54.614Z","harness:codex","Final local verification: linked PM tests pass; full sandboxed suite passes 376 files and 6,437 tests at exact 100% statements (44,398/44,398), branches (31,515/31,515), functions (9,082/9,082), and lines (43,135/43,135). Lint, zero-duplicate scan, 100% docstring/static quality, SDK surface/import/transport ratchets, docs/skills, secret scan, npm audit, compatibility, packed npx, 88-command package-first dogfood, and Sentry 14-day zero-critical/zero-high gate pass. Live tracker strict validation checked 2,117 items and 2,128 history streams with zero drift, duplicate IDs, config errors, driver drift, or pending receipts. Telemetry successfully flushed to the configured endpoint at 2026-07-26T23:49:30.656Z."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T23:47:24.151Z","harness:codex","Validating pending receipts before consuming a successfully recorded merge event creates a reconciliation deadlock. Consume the clone-local receipt immediately after its merge_reconcile event is durably written, then run the full workspace integrity scan; unrelated integrity failures still remain blocking."
